                                "example_id": "7e60dc5f-c4d1-4386-aaf6-c4a13c77d17f",
                                "sense_id": "1b0a0ed4-5c98-3cb6-96ba-abf7f408151a",
                                "text": "I'm as great on the side o' the law as it's siccar to be in thae uncertain times."
