                                "sense_id": "0230f7b8-ea86-3f15-ad38-b59776eafa3d",
                                "text": "No drop of water fell from the hot blue\nOr sickered from the skeleton of earth."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1ed9eb94-3327-42bf-a7c1-f75a85348fd1",
                                "sense_id": "0230f7b8-ea86-3f15-ad38-b59776eafa3d",
                                "text": "This cause had sickered into his soul; it had been branded upon his forehead somehow, by some hand; he knew not how nor by whom."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "147863f5-636b-4adb-bff6-cd3888681dc6",
                                "sense_id": "0230f7b8-ea86-3f15-ad38-b59776eafa3d",
                                "text": "The solution steadily sickered through the debris and the sampling of the solutions could be carried out without taking the equipment into pieces."
